### Animal Functions in Design
Every animal element should be mapped to its **functions**:
- **Fertility production** (manure → compost cycle)
- **Pest control** (chickens, ducks, guinea fowl)
- **Cultivation** (pigs, ducks: soil disturbance)
- **Pollination** (bees, solitary bees)
- **Biomass processing** (goats on brush, rabbits on clippings)
- **Harvest** (eggs, milk, meat, wool, honey, wax)

