## When Assisting with Permaculture Tasks

1. **Never suggest an isolated element.** Every addition must connect to at least two other system elements (outputs of one = inputs of another).
2. **Water before plants, plants before animals.** Respect implementation succession.
3. **Zone before sector.** Always clarify which zone the element belongs to before detailing it.
4. **Name functions, not just species.** "A nitrogen-fixing pioneer tree" before "Acacia auriculiformis".
5. **Use the vocabulary above consistently** across all UI text, help copy, documentation, and generated content.
